# Chem content seam

This repo is the S3 Chemistry site inside a UniPlus iframe. Teachers may add and rewrite teaching content freely. Generated quiz JS and platform wiring stay frozen.

## Do this

For the live MCQ quiz, edit source then rebuild:

1. `scripts/quiz/microscopic-world-i/questions.json`
2. `CHAPTER_META` (and the expected question count) in `scripts/quiz/microscopic-world-i/build_quiz.py`
3. Run `python3 scripts/quiz/microscopic-world-i/build_quiz.py`
4. Run `python3 scripts/quiz/microscopic-world-i/validate.py`

New questions get new `"n"` (and a new `"ch"` if it is a new topic). Never reuse or renumber an existing `"ch"` + `"n"` pair that is already published.

## Stop and ask the technical owner if the task needs

`public/quiz/**/js/quizData.js` (generated), `quizApp.js`, `quizUtils.js`, `quizExport.js`, `quizEffects.js`, `quizSummary.js`, `uni-tracker.js`, `postMessage`, `uniplus:*` payloads, `functions/`, `.github/`, Supabase, `fetch` / XHR, `uniplus_session`, or a new quiz data format.

## Before finishing

`build_quiz.py` must succeed. Confirm `public/quiz/microscopic-world-i/js/quizData.js` changed only because the script rewrote it. If a runner or tracking file is in the diff, revert it. Do not push.
